///|
/// Real x265 4:2:2 Annex B streams and FFmpeg 9.0.2 per-frame MD5 references
/// for the chroma-format-aware HEVC decoder.
///
/// Generation (docker `linuxserver/ffmpeg:9.0.2`, cwd = this directory):
///
/// ```
/// docker run --rm -v "$PWD:/w" -w /w linuxserver/ffmpeg:9.0.2 -v error \
///   -f lavfi -i "testsrc2=size=320x240:rate=10" -frames:v 3 \
///   -pix_fmt yuv422p -c:v libx265 \
///   -x265-params "keyint=7:min-keyint=7:bframes=0:wpp=0" \
///   -f hevc -y y422.265
/// docker run --rm -v "$PWD:/w" -w /w linuxserver/ffmpeg:9.0.2 -v error \
///   -f lavfi -i "testsrc2=duration=0.7:size=64x48:rate=10" -frames:v 7 \
///   -pix_fmt yuv422p -c:v libx265 \
///   -x265-params "keyint=7:min-keyint=7:bframes=2:scenecut=0:weightp=1:weightb=1" \
///   -f hevc -y y422b.265
/// docker run --rm -v "$PWD:/w" -w /w linuxserver/ffmpeg:9.0.2 -v error \
///   -f lavfi -i "testsrc2=duration=0.7:size=64x48:rate=10" -frames:v 7 \
///   -pix_fmt yuv422p10le -c:v libx265 \
///   -x265-params "keyint=7:min-keyint=7:bframes=2:scenecut=0:weightp=1:weightb=1" \
///   -f hevc -y m10_422.265
/// # filtered references:
/// docker run --rm -v "$PWD:/w" -w /w linuxserver/ffmpeg:9.0.2 \
///   -v error -i /w/y422.265 -f framemd5 -
/// # unfiltered (`-skip_loop_filter all`) references likewise.
/// ```
///
/// `hevc_y422_idr_b64` is the first (IDR) access unit of `y422.265`, for the
/// standalone intra-frame entry points. 4:2:2 has hshift = 1 and vshift = 0,
/// so chroma planes are half width but full height and each luma transform
/// unit carries two vertically stacked chroma blocks; the chroma intra mode
/// is remapped through `tab_mode_idx`.
///
/// Original FFmpeg code is LGPL-2.1-or-later; this port keeps the same license.

///|
